# ABP Text Templating

## Defining Templates
```csharp
public class MyTemplateDefinitionProvider : TemplateDefinitionProvider
{
    public override void Define(ITemplateDefinitionContext context)
    {
        context.Add(
            new TemplateDefinition("WelcomeEmail")
                .WithVirtualFilePath("/Templates/WelcomeEmail.tpl", isInlineLocalized: false)
        );
    }
}
```

## Template File (Scriban)
```
Hello {{model.name}},

Welcome to our application!
```

## Rendering Templates
```csharp
var result = await _templateRenderer.RenderAsync(
    "WelcomeEmail",
    new { Name = "John" }
);
```

## Template Engines
- Scriban (default): `Volo.Abp.TextTemplating.Scriban`
- Razor: `Volo.Abp.TextTemplating.Razor`
